### ============================================================
### Parse Server - Security API (template สำหรับ VS Code REST Client)
### คัดลอกไฟล์นี้เป็น api.http ในเครื่อง แล้วกรอกค่า REPLACE_WITH_... ก่อนใช้งาน
### ห้าม commit ไฟล์ api.http หรือค่า secret จริง
### ============================================================

@host = http://localhost:1337
@parseUrl = {{host}}/parse
@appId = REPLACE_WITH_APP_ID
@restKey = REPLACE_WITH_REST_API_KEY
@masterKey = REPLACE_WITH_MASTER_KEY

### Health Check
# @name health
GET {{host}}/health

###

### Health Check (Parse)
# @name parseHealth
GET {{parseUrl}}/health

###

### ============================================================
### AUTH
### ============================================================

### สมัครผู้ใช้ใหม่
# @name signUp
POST {{parseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
X-Parse-Application-Id: {{appId}}
X-Parse-REST-API-Key: {{restKey}}

{
  "username": "REPLACE_WITH_USERNAME",
  "password": "REPLACE_WITH_PASSWORD",
  "email": "REPLACE_WITH_EMAIL"
}

###

### ล็อกอินด้วยผู้ใช้ที่สมัครเมื่อกี้
# @name login
POST {{parseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Parse-Application-Id: {{appId}}
X-Parse-REST-API-Key: {{restKey}}

{
  "username": "{{signUp.request.body.$.username}}",
  "password": "{{signUp.request.body.$.password}}"
}

###

### ล็อกอินด้วย masterKey
# @name loginMaster
POST {{parseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Parse-Application-Id: {{appId}}
X-Parse-Master-Key: {{masterKey}}

{
  "username": "{{signUp.request.body.$.username}}",
  "password": "{{signUp.request.body.$.password}}"
}

###

### ดึงข้อมูล user ปัจจุบัน
# @name currentUser
GET {{parseUrl}}/users/me
X-Parse-Application-Id: {{appId}}
X-Parse-REST-API-Key: {{restKey}}
X-Parse-Session-Token: {{login.response.body.sessionToken}}

###

### เพิ่มผู้ใช้เข้า role SecurityAnalyst (ใช้ masterKey เท่านั้น)
# @name assignAnalystRole
POST {{parseUrl}}/functions/assignSecurityAnalystRole
Content-Type: application/json
X-Parse-Application-Id: {{appId}}
X-Parse-Master-Key: {{masterKey}}

{
  "userId": "{{signUp.response.body.objectId}}"
}

###

### ล็อกอินหลังได้ role
# @name loginAnalyst
POST {{parseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Parse-Application-Id: {{appId}}
X-Parse-REST-API-Key: {{restKey}}

{
  "username": "{{signUp.request.body.$.username}}",
  "password": "{{signUp.request.body.$.password}}"
}

###

### สร้างผู้ใช้เป้าหมายสำหรับทดสอบ quarantine
# @name quarantineTarget
POST {{parseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
X-Parse-Application-Id: {{appId}}
X-Parse-REST-API-Key: {{restKey}}

{
  "username": "REPLACE_WITH_TARGET_USERNAME",
  "password": "REPLACE_WITH_TARGET_PASSWORD",
  "email": "REPLACE_WITH_TARGET_EMAIL"
}

###

### ============================================================
### SECURITY FUNCTIONS (masterKey หรือ role SecurityAnalyst)
### ============================================================

### สแกนพอร์ตด้วย masterKey
# @name portScan
POST {{parseUrl}}/functions/runPortScan
Content-Type: application/json
X-Parse-Application-Id: {{appId}}
X-Parse-Master-Key: {{masterKey}}

{
  "host": "127.0.0.1",
  "ports": [22, 80, 443, 1337, 27017, 4040, 8080, 8443],
  "timeoutMs": 1500
}

###

### สร้าง Security Alert
# @name createAlert
POST {{parseUrl}}/functions/createSecurityAlert
Content-Type: application/json
X-Parse-Application-Id: {{appId}}
X-Parse-Master-Key: {{masterKey}}

{
  "severity": "high",
  "title": "REPLACE_WITH_ALERT_TITLE",
  "details": {
    "sourceIp": "REPLACE_WITH_SOURCE_IP",
    "attempts": 0,
    "service": "REPLACE_WITH_SERVICE"
  }
}

###

### รายงานสถานะความปลอดภัย
# @name securityReport
POST {{parseUrl}}/functions/getSecurityReport
Content-Type: application/json
X-Parse-Application-Id: {{appId}}
X-Parse-Master-Key: {{masterKey}}

{}

###

### เปลี่ยนสถานะ Alert ที่สร้างเมื่อกี้
# @name updateAlert
POST {{parseUrl}}/functions/updateAlertStatus
Content-Type: application/json
X-Parse-Application-Id: {{appId}}
X-Parse-Master-Key: {{masterKey}}

{
  "alertId": "{{createAlert.response.body.result.objectId}}",
  "status": "resolved",
  "note": "REPLACE_WITH_RESOLUTION_NOTE"
}

###

### กักกันผู้ใช้เป้าหมาย
# @name quarantine
POST {{parseUrl}}/functions/quarantineUser
Content-Type: application/json
X-Parse-Application-Id: {{appId}}
X-Parse-Master-Key: {{masterKey}}

{
  "userId": "{{quarantineTarget.response.body.objectId}}",
  "reason": "REPLACE_WITH_QUARANTINE_REASON"
}

###

### ปลดล็อกผู้ใช้เป้าหมาย
# @name unquarantine
POST {{parseUrl}}/functions/unquarantineUser
Content-Type: application/json
X-Parse-Application-Id: {{appId}}
X-Parse-Master-Key: {{masterKey}}

{
  "userId": "{{quarantineTarget.response.body.objectId}}"
}

###

### ============================================================
### QUERY (masterKey)
### ============================================================

### ดึง SecurityAlert ทั้งหมด
# @name queryAlerts
GET {{parseUrl}}/classes/SecurityAlert
X-Parse-Application-Id: {{appId}}
X-Parse-Master-Key: {{masterKey}}

###

### ดึง SecurityScan ล่าสุด 10 รายการ
# @name queryScans
GET {{parseUrl}}/classes/SecurityScan?order=-createdAt&limit=10
X-Parse-Application-Id: {{appId}}
X-Parse-Master-Key: {{masterKey}}

###

### ดึง SecurityLog ล่าสุด 20 รายการ
# @name queryLogs
GET {{parseUrl}}/classes/SecurityLog?order=-createdAt&limit=20
X-Parse-Application-Id: {{appId}}
X-Parse-Master-Key: {{masterKey}}

###

### ============================================================
### REST แบบใช้ session token ของ SecurityAnalyst
### ============================================================

### รัน port scan โดยใช้ session
# @name portScanWithSession
POST {{parseUrl}}/functions/runPortScan
Content-Type: application/json
X-Parse-Application-Id: {{appId}}
X-Parse-REST-API-Key: {{restKey}}
X-Parse-Session-Token: {{loginAnalyst.response.body.sessionToken}}

{
  "host": "127.0.0.1",
  "ports": [80, 443, 1337],
  "timeoutMs": 1000
}

###

### ดึง alert ของ user ปัจจุบัน
# @name myAlerts
GET {{parseUrl}}/classes/SecurityAlert
X-Parse-Application-Id: {{appId}}
X-Parse-REST-API-Key: {{restKey}}
X-Parse-Session-Token: {{loginAnalyst.response.body.sessionToken}}

###

### แก้ profile ตัวเอง
# @name updateProfile
PUT {{parseUrl}}/users/{{loginAnalyst.response.body.objectId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Parse-Application-Id: {{appId}}
X-Parse-REST-API-Key: {{restKey}}
X-Parse-Session-Token: {{loginAnalyst.response.body.sessionToken}}

{
  "securityFlags": {
    "twoFactorEnabled": true
  }
}

###

### ============================================================
### TESTS: request เหล่านี้คาดว่าจะถูกปฏิเสธ
### ============================================================

### [คาดว่าล้มเหลว] client เขียน SecurityLog ตรง ๆ ไม่ผ่าน
# @name blockLogWrite
POST {{parseUrl}}/classes/SecurityLog
Content-Type: application/json
X-Parse-Application-Id: {{appId}}
X-Parse-REST-API-Key: {{restKey}}

{
  "event": "REPLACE_WITH_TEST_EVENT",
  "meta": {}
}

###

### [คาดว่าล้มเหลว] client สร้าง class ใหม่ไม่ผ่าน
# @name blockClassCreation
POST {{parseUrl}}/classes/NewForbiddenClass
Content-Type: application/json
X-Parse-Application-Id: {{appId}}
X-Parse-REST-API-Key: {{restKey}}

{
  "foo": "bar"
}

###

### [คาดว่าล้มเหลว] masterKey จาก IP ที่ไม่ใช่ localhost
# @name blockMasterKeyFromRemote
GET {{parseUrl}}/classes/SecurityAlert
X-Parse-Application-Id: {{appId}}
X-Parse-Master-Key: {{masterKey}}
X-Forwarded-For: 203.0.113.10

###

### ออกจากระบบ
# @name logout
POST {{parseUrl}}/logout
Content-Type: application/json
X-Parse-Application-Id: {{appId}}
X-Parse-REST-API-Key: {{restKey}}
X-Parse-Session-Token: {{loginAnalyst.response.body.sessionToken}}

{}
